    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of Darkness is a tense survival game in a post-apocalyptic world where the player has to collect parts of a crashed car to save himself while avoiding deadly monsters. Four different creatures roam the world, each with their own special abilities that keep you constantly on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player needs not only to search for machine parts, but also to collect resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your health, stamina and noise level so as not to attract the attention of monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of ways to achieve the goal and decisions that will affect the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-horror adventure with elements of survival</p>",
